{
  "_format_version": 1,
  "_loader_notes": [
    "Daily quotes (AGENTS.md N7). All original, attribution 'Ascenda'. No lyrics or third-party quotes.",
    "Pick by date so everyone sees the same quote that day: list active quotes ordered by sort_order, then index = (days since 2026-01-01) mod count. With 100 quotes, none repeat for over three months.",
    "sort_order interleaves themes so consecutive days feel different. 'theme' is for your reference and possible future filtering.",
    "Adding quotes later: append with new ids and sort_orders. Deactivate with is_active=false rather than deleting.",
    "Respect profiles.hide_quote."
  ],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Showing up is the hardest rep. You've already done it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Strength is built quietly, one ordinary session at a time.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "The weight that felt heavy last month is your warm-up now.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "You belong in every corner of this gym.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "Be patient with yourself. Strength takes its time.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "text": "Strong enough to carry the shopping in one trip.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 6
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "text": "One set at a time. That's all you have to think about.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "text": "Every first time deserves a little celebration.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "You don't need a perfect week. You need a week with you in it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Consistent beats intense, every single time.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "One more rep is still progress.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "Everyone here was new once.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 12
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "text": "Rest is part of the plan, not a break from it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 13
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "text": "Train for the life you want to live, not just the next session.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "text": "Breathe, brace, lift. Then breathe again.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "text": "You chose yourself today. That's worth noticing.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 16
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Done is better than perfect, in the gym and everywhere else.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 17
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "The magic is in the weeks nobody sees.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 18
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "Look how far you've come, not how far you have to go.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 19
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "The free-weights area is for you too.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 20
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "A lighter day is still a good day.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 21
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "text": "Every squat is practice for every chair you'll ever stand up from.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 22
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "text": "Leave the day at the door for the next forty minutes.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 23
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "text": "Proud of the work, whatever the numbers say.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 24
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "One session is enough to keep the thread going.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 25
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Little by little is still a lot by the end.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 26
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "Strong today, stronger next week.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 27
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "Try one new thing today. That's how the gym becomes yours.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 28
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "text": "Listen to your body. It's on your side.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "text": "Strength you build now is strength you keep for years.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 30
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "text": "Focus on the rep you're doing, not the ones still to come.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 31
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "text": "A full week of training is a full week of keeping your word.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 32
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The version of you who turned up today is the one getting stronger.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 33
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Habits are just promises you keep to yourself.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 34
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "Two kilos at a time is how mountains are moved.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 35
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "Confidence isn't the starting point. It's what you build along the way.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 36
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "text": "Missed a session? Pick up where you are.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "text": "Lift for the energy, stay for the confidence.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 38
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "text": "Hard sets end. The pride stays.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 39
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "text": "You started something. Look at you keep it going.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 40
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Ten minutes still counts. It always counts.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 41
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Progress loves a routine.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 42
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "Every personal best started as a new beginning.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 43
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "Nobody's watching as closely as you think. Train for you.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 44
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "text": "New week, fresh start.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 45
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "text": "Feeling capable is the best kind of strong.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 46
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "text": "You can do hard things. You do them every session.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 47
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "text": "Count the wins: the sessions, the firsts, the weeks.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 48
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Start small. Small is how everything strong began.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 49
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Repeat the basics until they feel like yours.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 50
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "Notice the small wins. They're the big ones in disguise.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 51
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "Ask the question. Take the space. Lift the weight.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "text": "You're allowed to go gently and still go forward.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 53
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "text": "Strong bones, steady joints, a clearer head. All from here.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 54
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "text": "Don't wait for motivation. Let the first exercise find it for you.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 55
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "text": "The hardest part of today is already behind you.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 56
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Getting here was the decision. The rest is just the plan.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 57
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Strong is something you practise, not something you're born with.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 58
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Your progress doesn't have to be loud to be real.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 59
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "Every machine was unfamiliar until you tried it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 60
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "text": "Recovery is where the strength settles in.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 61
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "text": "You're not just training muscles. You're building trust in yourself.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 62
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "text": "Effort is the part you control. Make it count.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 63
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "text": "You did the thing. Now enjoy the rest of your day.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 64
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Some days the win is simply walking through the door.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 65
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Today's session is a brick. Keep building.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 66
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "Slow progress is still progress. Keep going.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 67
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "Curiosity first, confidence follows.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 68
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "text": "Talk to yourself like you'd talk to a friend at the gym.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 69
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "text": "The gym is where you practise being someone who doesn't give up.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 70
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "text": "A calm mind lifts better.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 71
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "text": "You're stronger than when you started. That's the whole point.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 72
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "You don't have to feel ready. You just have to begin.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 73
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "You're not starting over. You're carrying on.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 74
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "You're lifting things today you couldn't lift when you started.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 75
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "Your plan is your map. You know where you're going today.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 76
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "There's no falling behind. There's only your next session.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 77
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "text": "Strong looks like whatever you can do now that you couldn't before.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 78
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "text": "When it feels tough, slow down and own the movement.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 79
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "text": "This is what starting looks like, and you've already started.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 80
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "A short session beats the perfect one you didn't do.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 81
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "The best plan is the one you keep coming back to.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 82
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "Better form is a personal best too.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 83
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "Taking up space is allowed. So is taking your time.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 84
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "text": "Your pace is the right pace.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 85
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "text": "Move well today so you can keep moving for years.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 86
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "text": "The plan is set. All you have to do is follow it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 87
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "text": "Today you trained. That's the headline.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 88
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Every week you train is a week that counts.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "Steady weeks make strong months.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 90
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Climb at your own pace. The view is still yours.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "progress",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 91
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "A little brave today, a lot more at home here next month.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "confidence",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 92
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "text": "Stretch, breathe, reset. Then go again.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 93
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "text": "Strength makes everything else a little easier.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "strength_for_life",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 94
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "text": "Finish the set with good form and you've done your job.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "focus_and_mindset",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 95
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "text": "Small steps, big climb. Enjoy the view on the way up.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "celebration",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 96
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Turning up when it's hard is how it becomes easy.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "showing_up",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 97
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "Your weeks trained only ever go up.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "consistency",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 98
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "text": "Coming back is always worth it.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 99
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "text": "Good sleep is training too.",
      "attribution": "Ascenda",
      "theme": "kindness",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 100
    }
  ]
}